      "do": "Oven 325°; parchment-lined sheet pan. Pat salmon dry; salt + pepper. Stir 6 Tbsp dill, grated ginger, 2 Tbsp olive oil, salt + pepper; spread half on salmon; bake 15–20 min until it flakes. Cut peel off grapefruit and oranges; squeeze peels into the remaining dill-ginger; slice fruit into half-moons; add with juices, radish wedges and salt. Plate salmon in pieces with citrus salad and avocado quarters; spoon juices over; pepper + olive oil.",
